00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.500
ANNIE WANG: Hi, everyone.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.240
Welcome to this
agentic pattern series.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.800
So if you're building
with AI, you probably

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:15.020
wonder how to really
design the agentic system.

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.480
Sometimes you need
a single agent,

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:21.480
and other times you need a whole
team of them working together.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.720
And today, we are diving into
AI agent design patterns,

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:27.920
and each pattern we're
going to provide you

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.100
with practical examples of code.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.600
And we're also going to
walk through a live demo.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.600
And by the end of this
agentic pattern series,

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.600
you will learn how to
build agentic solution

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.540
from single agent pattern to
different multi-agent pattern.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.600
And for today's
episode, we will focus

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:48.960
on practical examples of
single agent, sequential agent,

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.480
